    "category": "Binary Search",
    "difficulty": "Easy",
    "problemStatement": "A hidden number is chosen between 1 and n. You are provided with an API: guess(num) returns: o -1 if the hidden number is lower. o 1 if the hidden number is higher. o 0 if the guess is correct. Find the hidden number using binary search.",
